### Variaveis
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health check -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Listar pacientes -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients

### 3. Buscar paciente por id -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1

### 4. FALHA: paciente inexistente -> 404 no contrato central
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999

### 5. Cadastrar paciente -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente de Teste",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "nationalId": "888888888888888"
}

### 6. FALHA: CNS repetido -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente de Teste (duplicado)",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "nationalId": "888888888888888"
}

### 7. FALHA: sem name -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "nationalId": "111111111111111"
}

### 8. Listar atendimentos do paciente 1 -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters

### 9. Registrar atendimento -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-09-02T10:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Consulta de rotina"
}

### 10. FALHA: paciente inexistente em encounters -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters

### 11. Zod: dois campos invalidos -> 400 com details.name e details.birthDate
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "birthDate": "data-invalida",
  "nationalId": "123"
}

### 12. Upload de foto -> 200
### Ajuste o caminho abaixo para uma imagem JPEG local antes de executar.
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 12a. Upload para paciente inexistente -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/patients/9999/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 12b. Upload sem arquivo -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 12c. Arquivo grande demais -> 413
### Ajuste para um JPEG/PNG com mais de 2 MB.
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="grande.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./grande.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 13. Tipo nao permitido -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="arquivo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

conteudo de teste
------WebKitFormBoundary--
